<title>USA: TABLE - Intelect Comm Q2 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Intelect Comm Q2 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>RICHARDSON, Texas 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months	Six months</p>
<p>					    ended		ended</p>
<p>					   June 30	    June 30</p>
<p> ($ thousands except per share data)  1997  1996  1997   1996</p>
<p> Net Revenues			9,007   1,916   13,544   5,288</p>
