<p>Wtd. Avg. Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>					19,810  13,317   18,210  13,162</p>
<p>NOTE: Intelect Communications Systems Ltd said its net loss for the second quarter of 1997 includes $1,077,000 of non-cash charges primarily associated with financing transactions, approximately $200,000 of extraordinary expenses incurred in relocating the corporate offices to Richardson, Texas, from Bermuda and $327,000 of non-cash amortization.</p>
